> <span begin="0:19.309" end="0:19.790">fine</span></p><p begin="0:20.013" end="0:23.191" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.013" end="0:20.236">'Cause</span> <span begin="0:20.236" end="0:20.896">I know</span> <span begin="0:20.896" end="0:21.286">Pe</span><span begin="0:21.286" end="0:21.518">ter</span> <span begin="0:21.676" end="0:22.007">Pan</span> <span begin="0:22.007" end="0:22.215">was</span> <span begin="0:22.417" end="0:23.191">right</span></p></div><div begin="0:23.315" end="0:56.606" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0:23.315" end="0:25.991" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.315" end="0:23.681">Just</span> <span begin="0:23.681" end="0:24.145">a</span> <span begin="0:24.145" end="0:24.482">lost</span> <span begin="0:24.482" end="0:24.814">boy</span> <span begin="0:24.814" end="0:25.003">in</span> <span begin="0:25.003" end="0:25.503">a small</span> <span begin="0:25.631" end="0:25.991">town</span></p><p begin="0:26.394" end="0:28.756" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.394" end="0:26.863">I'm the</span> <span begin="0:26.863" end="0:27.124">same</span> <span begin="0:27.292" end="0:27.595">kid</span> <span begin="0:27.595" end="0:27.851">but</span> <span begin="0:27.851" end="0:28.012">I'm</span> <span begin="0:28.012" end="0:28.342">grown</span> <span begin="0:28.342" end="0:28.756">now</span></p><p begin="0:29.169" end="0:31.829" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.169" end="0:29.347">Try to</span> <span begin="0:29.844" end="0:30.053">make</span> <span begin="0:30.053" end="0:30.199">it</span> <span begin="0:30.199" end="0:30.775">out</span> <span begin="0:30.907" end="0:31.063">but</span> <span begin="0:31.063" end="0:31.238">I don't</span> <span begin="0:31.238" end="0:31.396">know</span> <span begin="0:31.396" end="0:31.829">how</span></p><p begin="0:31.925" end="0:34.795" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.925" end="0:32.193">Wish</span> <span begin="0:32.303" end="0:32.696"